cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  dejafix is a fork of projectmem. If you use it in research or writing, please
  cite the original projectmem paper below.
title: "dejafix"
type: software
abstract: >-
  dejafix is a local-first memory and judgment layer for AI coding agents,
  forked from projectmem 0.3.5. It records issues, attempts, fixes, decisions
  and notes as typed events in plain text, serves them to agents through a
  native MCP server, and warns before an approach that already failed is
  repeated.
authors:
